<title>UK: Innovative Tech in 10.7 mln stg U.S. deal.</title>
<headline>Innovative Tech in 10.7 mln stg U.S. deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innovative Technologies Group Plc said on Monday it would buy Polymedica Industries Inc of the U.S. for 10.7 million stg, paid for by a placing and open offer to raise about 12.7 million stg before expenses.</p>
</text>
